WHAT THIS DATASET CONTAINS

The dataset in the Datasets/ folder (and its copy in Supplementary_Materials/Datasets/)
consists of numerically perturbed mathematical problem instances created by the authors
from publicly available NCERT and SCERT Class 11 mathematics textbooks published by
the Government of India. The original textbooks are freely available at:

  - NCERT:    https://ncert.nic.in/textbook.php
  - Gujarat SCERT: https://gujarat-education.gov.in
  - West Bengal SCERT: https://www.scerttripura.org
  - Kerala SCERT: https://samagra.kite.kerala.gov.in

ORIGINAL CONTRIBUTION OF THE AUTHORS

The following elements of this dataset are entirely original contributions
of the authors and are covered by this license:

  - Numerical perturbations applied to each problem (modified numerical values
    that change the answer while preserving mathematical structure)
  - Manually derived and verified ground-truth solutions for all perturbed problems
  - Cross-lingual alignment of problems across six languages (English, Hindi,
    Bengali, Urdu, Gujarati, Malayalam)
  - Subcategory annotations and problem categorisation
  - The dataset construction pipeline described in Section 2 of the paper

The underlying mathematical problem structures are drawn from government-published
educational textbooks and are not claimed as original by the authors.

